dumb
------------------------------------------
DUMB is a module audio renderer library. It reads module files and outputs
audio that can be dumped to the actual audio playback library.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libSDL2_2.0_0-2.32.74-1
  libargtable2_0-13-1bl6
  libdumb-devel-2.0.3-1bl3
  libdumb2-2.0.3-1bl3
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.5-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libSDL2-devel-2.32.74-1
  libargtable2-devel-13-1bl6
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/kode54/dumb

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/kode54/dumb/archive/refs/tags/2.0.3.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack dumb-2.0.3-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./dumb-2.0.3-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/dumb-2.0.3-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/dumb-2.0.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdumb2-2.0.3-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libdumb-devel-2.0.3-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(dumb)
  /usr/bin/dumbout.exe
  /usr/bin/dumbplay.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/dumb.README
  /usr/share/doc/dumb/CHANGELOG.md
  /usr/share/doc/dumb/COMPILING.md
  /usr/share/doc/dumb/DUMBFILE_SYSTEM.md
  /usr/share/doc/dumb/LICENSE
  /usr/share/doc/dumb/README.md
  /usr/share/doc/dumb/UPDATING_YOUR_PROJECTS.md

(libdumb2)
  /usr/bin/cygdumb-2.dll

(libdumb-devel)
  /usr/include/dumb.h
  /usr/lib/libdumb.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/dumb.pc

